{"unit_id":"Lbunc__dsh-composer-glass#feature-01","repo":"Lbunc/dsh-composer-glass","commit":"75a873e4b6ab0c48fbf7d1da919cca960549dc8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-glass 的功能「毛玻璃外观」：为输入卡片、浮动部件、状态胶囊、回到底部按钮和侧栏等界面表面应用统一的模糊与半透明样式；各组可独立开关和调节。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:300-390"]}
