{"unit_id":"Lbunc__dsh-composer-glass#feature-03","repo":"Lbunc/dsh-composer-glass","commit":"75a873e4b6ab0c48fbf7d1da919cca960549dc8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-glass 的功能「本地壁纸与循环视频」：可使用本地图片或视频作为界面背景，调整铺满或完整显示及明暗；客户端加载媒体并让视频循环播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1286-1349"]}
{"unit_id":"Lbunc__dsh-composer-glass#feature-04","repo":"Lbunc/dsh-composer-glass","commit":"75a873e4b6ab0c48fbf7d1da919cca960549dc8c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-glass 的功能「选择并保存壁纸文件」：配置页的文件选择器可上传支持的图片或视频，主机保存文件并将路径返回配置；上传大小上限为 512 MiB。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1726-1810"]}
{"unit_id":"Lbunc__dsh-composer-glass#caveat-01","repo":"Lbunc/dsh-composer-glass","commit":"75a873e4b6ab0c48fbf7d1da919cca960549dc8c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-glass 使用 Web 服务路由读取配置的壁纸文件；通过面板挑选时，文件会复制到 DSH 的本机存储目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:411-432","lib/index.js:508-580"]}
